    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1097" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγων-ιάω</span></b> , inf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
