					<u>Prt.</u>
					333e
				</span></i>
			, part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Chrm.</u>
					162c
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				4.91
			</span></i>: impf.
