				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.10.6
				</span></i>
			, etc.: fut.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άσω
			[ᾱ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				1.54
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠγωνίᾱσα</span>”
