				3p.151
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1367a15
				</span></i>
			: c.acc., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.20.6
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					46
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μή</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.9.2
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εἴ τι πείσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.Dam.
					<u>Vit. Caes.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
